    "quote": "",
    "summary": "This brief Gah V passage lists homage and sacrifices offered to Nmanya, Sraosha, Rashnu, and Arcta/, then describes a speaker blessing the sacrifices, homage, strength, and swiftness of Sraosha (identified as Obedience), as well as the sacrifices of Rashnu and Ansta^, noting especially their justice, sanctity, victory, and roles in advancing and increasing human settlements. A note references the Ashem and Ahmai rae^a.",
    "language": "English",
    "quote_policy": "summarized"
  },
  "literal_observations": [
    {
      "id": "obs:1",
      "text": "Homage is mentioned as being offered to Nmanya, described as \"the lord.\"",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:2",
      "text": "The community \"we\" is said to sacrifice to Sraosha.",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:3",
      "text": "The same passage states that sacrifices are offered to Rashnu, who is called \"the most just.\"",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:1",
        "ev:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:4",
      "text": "Sacrifice is also offered to Arcta/, who is described as causing the settlements to advance and to increase.",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:1",
        "ev:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:5",
      "text": "A first-person speaker says \"I bless\" the sacrifice, homage, strength, and swiftness of Sraosha.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:6",
      "text": "Sraosha is characterized as Obedience, blessed, endowed with sanctity, smiting with the blow of victory, and causing the settlements to advance.",
      "category": "attribute",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:7",
      "text": "The speaker blesses the sacrifice of Rashnu, again described as \"the most just.\"",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2",
        "ev:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:8",
      "text": "The speaker blesses the sacrifice of Ansta^, who is described as causing the settlements to advance and to increase.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2",
        "ev:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:9",
      "text": "Settlements are repeatedly said to advance and increase through the activity of Arcta/, Ansta^, and Sraosha.",
      "category": "setting",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2",
        "ev:4"
